s altered.\n13: \n14: ## Repair groups applied\n15: \n16: **G1 — §13.2 register atomicity (one value per row).** Ten flagged rows were split so each row carries one independently displayed fact. The original ID is kept for the first atomic fact; additional facts take fresh sequential IDs from the current maximum. Repeated-display locators were updated on every affected row (T7 cell + §12.1 佐證 index + §12.2 追蹤結果 cell now all carried where the same value repeats).\n17: \n18: | Split of | Atomic facts now separate | New IDs |\n19: |---|---|---|\n20: | SF-0057-184 | `Q1=2 次` / `Q2=4` / `Q3=5` | 204, 205 |\n21: | SF-0057-186 | `R1=3` / `R2=2` / `R3=3` / `R4=2` / 合計 `10/12` | 206, 207, 208, 209 |\n22: | SF-0057-188 | 接觸紀錄筆數 `3 筆` / 觸發轉介界線筆數 `1 筆` | 210 |\n23: | SF-0057-191 | `2025-04-15` / `2025-06-13` | 211 |\n24: | SF-0057-192 | `C2` / `C3` | 212 |\n25: | SF-0057-194 | 時限 `24 小時內` / `每月 2 班` | 213 |\n26: | SF-0057-195 | 例會抽查回饋 / 界線判準卡 | 214 |\n27: | SF-0057-198 | `時間不足` / `紀錄表欄位偏多（18 欄）` / `缺乏即時回饋` | 215, 216 |\n28: | SF-0057-199 | 接觸紀錄抽查 `3 筆` / 觀察量尺 `10/12` | 217 |\n29: | SF-0057-201 | 圖 3 節點 (1)–(6) 六段節點文字 | 218–222 |\n30: \n31: **G2 — T8 locators (values unchanged).** Added the exact T8 cell locator to `SF-0057-115` (`T8 / P1 列 / 陪伴組應用率欄`), `118` (`T8 / P1 列 / 無陪伴組應用率欄`), `121` (`T8 / P2 列 / 陪伴組應用率欄`), `124` (`T8 / P2 列 / 無陪伴組應用率欄`), `127` (`T8 / P3 列 / 陪伴組應用率欄`), `130` (`T8 / P3 列 / 無陪伴組應用率欄`).\n32: \n33: **G3 — T9 coverage + §11 date.** Registered the five F1–F5 action texts (`SF-0057-223`–`227`), the four missing F1/F2/F4/F5 re-tracking indicators (`SF-0057-228`–`231`; F3 coverage retained via `SF-0057-130`), and the `2027 上半年重檢` date (`SF-0057-232`, §11 補述).\n34: \n35: **G4 — `SF-0057-001` locator.** Removed the ambiguous \"T1 data-cell\" reading. The locator now names only occurrences that actually display `2026-06-30`: the `T1` 欄定義 / 資料截點列 (type note「全數 = 2026-06-30」), §5.1 段首, §5.1 硬規則1, §5.1 硬規則2, §8.3 規則5, and the T1 註. No T1 column was added and no unregistered repeated value was introduced (smallest schema-preserving locator correction).\n36: \n37: **G5 — schema/table consistency (computed values unchanged).** `T3`: the field schema now uses one canonical column set identical to the T3 example table (`period_id` / `能力項` / `滿分` / `總分門檻` / `該期達標率`); `評量題數` was removed with a stated reason (total-score design, no per-item item counts — listing it would fabricate item statistics), and `各項滿分`→`滿分`, `達門檻標準`→`總分門檻`. `T8`: a `欄 | 型別` schema table was added whose column names are identical to the T8 example table, plus a note that T5 rate values are repeated displays logged under the same `fact_id`.\n38: \n39: ## New IDs allocated (29 total)\n40: \n41: `SF-0057-204` … `SF-0057-232` (contiguous, no gaps, no duplicates; next free = `SF-0057-233`). Grouped: 204–222 (atomicity), 223–232 (T9 coverage + §11 date). Every new fact row is marked `SYNTHETIC`; actual association records/decisions remain `UNKNOWN / PENDING_REAL_SOURCE`.\n42: \n43: ## Deterministic checks run (all before reporting)\n44: \n45: A script re-read the written R04 bytes and ran **100 checks, 0 failures**:\n46: - **Register integrity**: 232 `fact_id` rows; IDs unique and contiguous 1–232; every row has exactly 10 cells.\n47: - **T2 arithmetic**: six rates × P1/P2/P3 recomputed from their own numerator/denominator cells (all match); merged row = column-wise sums of P1+P2+P3; `P3-Q2` left `—` with `A=14` informational only; nesting `G≤E≤D≤C≤A` and `F≤B≤A` per cohort.\n48: - **T4**: `Tier-A + Tier-B + Tier-C = E` and `G = Tier-A + Tier-B` per cohort; `G/E` recomputed; Tier-A record-count column kept separate from persons.\n49: - **T5**: group 涵蓋/應用 sums equal the period `D`/`E`; every group rate recomputed; merged `33+41=74`, `26+22=48`; P3 gap `75.0 − 50.0 = 25.0` pp.\n50: - **T6**: `失聯 + 拒訪 = C − D` per cohort and per merged row.\n51: - **Schema reconciliation**: T3 has no `評量題數` row; T3 schema names equal T3 example header; T8 schema names equal T8 example head